[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1620.019, "timestamp": "00:27:00", "text": "那不是某種東西 這是人們所期望的，因為："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1621.417, "timestamp": "00:27:01", "text": "這是人們所期望的，因為： 呃，是的，他不應該。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1622.815, "timestamp": "00:27:02", "text": "呃，是的，他不應該。 這是人們所期望的，而且這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1623.955, "timestamp": "00:27:03", "text": "這是人們所期望的，而且這 這個人希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1625.059, "timestamp": "00:27:05", "text": "這個人希望 這種慾望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1626.346, "timestamp": "00:27:06", "text": "這種慾望 呃，聽到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1627.45, "timestamp": "00:27:07", "text": "呃，聽到了 星星。或者，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1633.816, "timestamp": "00:27:13", "text": "星星。或者，呃， 一個人站著，嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1635.641, "timestamp": "00:27:15", "text": "一個人站著，嗯。 呃，從上面。所以，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1639.381, "timestamp": "00:27:19", "text": "呃，從上面。所以，而且 然後，這種願望是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1643.301, "timestamp": "00:27:23", "text": "然後，這種願望是 初始，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1644.513, "timestamp": "00:27:24", "text": "初始，呃， 願望是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1650.256, "timestamp": "00:27:30", "text": "完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1656.208, "timestamp": "00:27:36", "text": "透過來自上層的權力，以及那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1657.668, "timestamp": "00:27:37", "text": "呃，誰比…更大"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1660.347, "timestamp": "00:27:40", "text": "我想應該是我吧。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1663.668, "timestamp": "00:27:43", "text": "所以，又一個類似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1666.206, "timestamp": "00:27:46", "text": "事情發生了。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1667.513, "timestamp": "00:27:47", "text": "想想看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1668.686, "timestamp": "00:27:48", "text": "沒錯，還有執行方面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1669.624, "timestamp": "00:27:49", "text": "慾望是有價值的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1674.528, "timestamp": "00:27:54", "text": "許多。嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "tim